   "line": 6,
   "text": "Two hundred twenty-five is one hundred thirty-five short of a full turn. So the whistle looks like a three thousand hertz dot turning backwards, and samples can't tell backwards from forwards. It's the cinema wheel. A fast car wheel, filmed too rarely, seems to creep backwards.",
