  {
   "line": 9,
   "text": "The fix has to come before sampling, while five thousand is still five thousand. Put a filter in front of the sampler, a small circuit that keeps the voice, up to three thousand four hundred hertz, and fades out the tones above it. The tone where it switches from keeping to removing is its cutoff, here four thousand. The whistle never reaches the sampler, and the clinic gets honest silence.",
